;;; Description: MDB query plan optimization of multidatabase query plans.
;;;              New Decomposition Trees are generated by
;;;              merging consecutive SAE nodes, thus distributing the
;;;              decomposition tree.
;;;              The tree with minimal cost is chosen as a result.
